  "readmeFile": "ReadmeNuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- ListField: a column's Width is now treated as a guaranteed minimum. Columns are no longer squeezed below the specified width on narrow screens (the excess scrolls horizontally).\n- ListField: added the \"Fixed Max Width\" (IsMaxWidthFixed) column option. A checked column keeps its specified width and the surplus width is absorbed by the other columns.\n- ListField: the command column (detail / delete buttons) no longer stretches when every data column has a fixed width.\n- ListField: fixed columns now stay opaque over striped row backgrounds.\n- ListField: added the SetHeaderText / ClearHeaderTexts script APIs to change column header texts at runtime (design labels are used again after clearing).\n- BooleanField: checkbox / switch / toggle are now vertically centered in list cells.\n- FileField: reworked the layout. The upload button aligns with other inputs, the file name is shown in a single line with an ellipsis and a full-name tooltip, and the delete button stays right after the name.\n- FileField: added PreviewWidth / PreviewHeight to size the image preview independently of the field. A specified dimension is kept as-is, the other follows the image aspect ratio within the cell, and ObjectFit decides how the image fits the frame. The preview no longer overflows fixed-height rows.\n- FileField: drag and drop now shows visual feedback. All drop targets are highlighted while a file is dragged, the hovered target shows an overlay, the whole field including the preview accepts drops, and disabled fields reject them.\n- FileField: the delete button is now disabled while the field is disabled. Downloading stays available in both the disabled and the read-only state (it is a read operation).\n- Fixed an unhandled exception when directly opening the URL of an existing record the user has no read permission for. An access error message is shown instead.\n- Design-time preview: a module with CanUpdate but without CanCreate is no longer rendered read-only in the designer preview.",
